WEBVTT

00:00:29.996 --> 00:00:32.596
Keep your eyes shut
just for a moment longer.

00:00:32.636 --> 00:00:35.796
And imagine waking up now,
but instead of those beautiful images,

00:00:35.836 --> 00:00:38.596
all you could see is
what you're seeing right now.

00:00:39.756 --> 00:00:40.996
Darkness.

00:00:41.436 --> 00:00:44.796
Those thoughts, those images
of the first thing you saw this morning

00:00:44.836 --> 00:00:47.516
being exactly what it is now,

00:00:47.556 --> 00:00:49.036
just a memory,

00:00:49.076 --> 00:00:52.396
an image conjured
by your brain from your past.

00:00:53.356 --> 00:00:54.836
Now open your eyes.

00:00:55.796 --> 00:00:59.356
When I asked people what the one sense
that they couldn't live without is

00:00:59.356 --> 00:01:02.236
most people immediately say, their sight.